    "text": "(1)in subsection (3) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cmale young persons who have attained theage of sixteen years but are under the age of eighteenyears \u201d of the words \u201cmale young persons\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
